  <p>Broader regression limitation: Search and Rescue and Paru free-roam pass.
  The Paru Pact route stops at s05a_lc2, cell 3,4, position approximately
  (-14.8,0.2,-20.9), with no floor ahead. Unchanged main 3c0e8b28 reproduces
  the same failure from the same post-SR save. Gurhacia/Rioh navigation probes
  also fail on that baseline. These findings do not constitute a green full
  story regression, and downstream story progression remains unverified here.</p>
</Concept>
